/// One row of a stage's pass-criteria checklist: what is required, what was measured,
/// and whether it passes right now.
///
/// The plan's pass criteria live in `docs/PLAN.md` as a table the user fills in by
/// hand. Putting the same table on screen with live values removes the transcription
/// step — and, more usefully, makes it obvious *while adjusting the setup* which
/// criterion is the one still failing.
struct PassCriterion: Identifiable {

    enum Verdict {
        case pass
        case fail
